Yes, magic marker is probably the smarter way.  But before that, do you
know if your luck is near max?  The chance of writing an unknown
scroll/book is luck dependent.  You shuold look into maxing out your
luck first if you haven't.

Then, you can write a book of identify if you have some un-IDed
scrolls.  You might already have a scroll of charging and not know it.
Then, if you still doesn't have a scroll of charging, write one.
Remember to bless that one.

