You can possibly get a neutral/lawful artifact if you change your
alignment.  You can always use the helm of opposite alignment if you
don't want to permanently mess up your alignment, and get the magic
mirror of merlin or something that provides magic resistance.  The
problem is, you've already had 4 artifacts (that we know of).  I think
you might end up blowing a lot of wishes just to successfully get *1*
artifact.  Probably not efficient use of the wishes.  I say you should
stick with Cloak of Magic Resistance.  I don't see why you 'really'
want the cloak of protection anyways.

